# UNDERDELVE: a new delve starts at Mo's camp, on the west side of an 8x8
# mine, with six lanterns. Mo walks, and his jumps are committed: pushing the
# other way in mid-air changes nothing.
game underdelve
wait 15
cheat no_gloom
expect state == 1
expect map_errors == 0
expect room_x == 1
expect room_y == 5
expect lanterns == 6
expect grounded == 1
hold RIGHT 20
expect px > 50
hold RIGHT+A 3
expect grounded == 0
hold LEFT 12
expect px > 60
wait 40
expect grounded == 1
